flowchart TD
  A[User problem / Problema de usuario] --> B[Tokens / Tokens]
  B --> C[Atoms / Átomos]
  C --> D[Molecules / Moléculas]
  D --> E[Organisms / Organismos]
  E --> F[Layout / Layout]
  F --> G[States / Estados]
  G --> H[Accessibility + responsive / Accesibilidad + responsive]
  H --> I[Evidence / Evidencia]
  G -->|Missing state / Falta estado| C
  H -->|Fails / Falla| B

  classDef level fill:#11161d,stroke:#72a7ff,color:#f5f7fa
  classDef quality fill:#16291f,stroke:#3ddc97,color:#f5f7fa
  classDef loop fill:#2b2020,stroke:#ff6b7a,color:#f5f7fa
  class A,B,C,D,E,F,G level
  class H,I quality
